  "notes": "Checks ran after merging int (c9f060740) into the branch. durationMs 0 means the duration was not recorded. 'npm run -s check:freeze' exits 1 against origin/main because int carries the P1-65 changeset (.changeset/a4-cli.md, freeze-exception: P1-65), which origin/main's baseline does not yet allow; it is not caused by P1-27, and the same check passes with --base-ref int (command paths unchanged at 1255; --attest is a flag). amc-verify exits 3 on the valid attestation by design (satisfaction NOT_RECOMPUTABLE) and 1 on the tampered AIBOM (EVIDENCE_MISSING). Tests: the 23 files are every new or changed P1-27 test plus the existing tests that cover bundle.ts, the control-result contract, the verifier package and its fixtures; the full suite was not run. Keyless signing and CycloneDX schema validation are not exercised."
